    # "A stallion steps up to the table and makes eye contact with [rosa]."
    "一匹公马走到桌前，与[ros]四目相对。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:203
translate chinese brosa_2033e486:

    # misc "Hey, [rosa]! Sorry about being pushy last time, can I make it up to you with a drink?"
    misc "嘿，[rosa]！对不起，上次我有点太唐突了，我请你喝杯酒赔不是怎么样？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:205
translate chinese brosa_1894115d:

    # ros "Uuuu, gotta go, [mc]!"
    ros "噢噢噢，先走一步了，[mc]！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:208
translate chinese brosa_b88fe71d:

    # "Uh oh, I recognize that glint in her eyes. Maybe I should check up on her."
    "糟了，我认得她那眼神……也许我该跟上去看看她的情况。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:220
translate chinese rosamenu_925e7787:

    # "Not enough monies!"
    "资金不足！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:228
translate chinese rosamenu_925e7787_1:

    # "Not enough monies!"
    "资金不足！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:255
translate chinese hildaintro_089001ba:

    # "As I walked towards [hil], I couldn’t help but feel a strange connection. Like her, I wasn’t originally from this world. We both have our own reasons for being here, both thrust into a life we hadn’t anticipated."
    "当我走向[hil]时，我不禁感觉我们之间有一股奇妙的羁绊，就像她一样，我并非诞生于这个世界。我们各自背负着不同的理由来到此地，被命运推入这段始料未及的人生。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:256
translate chinese hildaintro_b2797f0f:

    # mc "[hil], right? Mind if I join you?"
    mc "你叫[hil]，对吧？介意我坐一下吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:257
translate chinese hildaintro_4fe7d822:

    # "She looked up, her piercing emerald eyes striking straight to the heart."
    "她抬起头来，那双碧绿如翡翠的眼睛直击心底。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:258
translate chinese hildaintro_b461c596:

    # hil "Take a seat, new guy. [rub] told me a bit about you."
    hil "坐吧，新人。[rub]和我提起过一些你的事。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:259
translate chinese hildaintro_603bb1a2:

    # "I slid onto the bar stool next to her, signaling the bartender for a drink."
    "我坐到她旁边的吧台凳上，朝酒保示意来一杯。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:260
translate chinese hildaintro_29faae2c:

    # mc "Yeah, I started recently. [rub] mentioned we might have some things in common."
    mc "是的，我最近才来，[rub]说我们之间或许有些共通之处。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:262
translate chinese hildaintro_952c9e69:

    # hil "Oh? And what might those be?"
    hil "哦？比如说什么？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:263
translate chinese hildaintro_d610f561:

    # mc "Your crash landing sounds like quite a story. Surely such a thing is an insane revelation for a planet-bound civilization?"
    mc "你的坠机，对一个从未仰望过星空的文明来说，简直就像天方夜谭吧？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:264
translate chinese hildaintro_21f3ef60:

    # "She chuckled softly, taking a sip of her drink."
    "她轻轻笑了笑，抿了一口杯中的酒。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:266
translate chinese hildaintro_c61c5033:

    # hil "You could say that. But not many people believe me when I tell them I’m from another planet. They just think it’s part of the ‘mysterious adventurer’ act."
    hil "可以这么说吧，但当我告诉他们我来自另一颗星球时，大多数人根本不信，他们只当这是‘神秘冒险者’人设的一部分。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:267
translate chinese hildaintro_51550f05:

    # mc "I believe you. I know what it’s like to end up somewhere you didn’t plan on being. I guess you could say, I know what it’s like to be trapped away from home."
    mc "我信，我懂那种被命运带到陌生之地，困在他乡的滋味。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:269
translate chinese hildaintro_b9843ddd:

    # hil "Trapped? So, what’s your story then?"
    hil "客居他乡？那么，你的故事又是什么呢？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:270
translate chinese hildaintro_80ff1446:

    # "I give her the footnotes of my experience. Having already explained this a few times already, I’ve gotten pretty efficient at it."
    "我把自己的经历简单讲了一遍。毕竟这已经不是第一次讲了，我的叙述也早已变得精炼。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:271
translate chinese hildaintro_8d204e83:

    # mc "It’s a strange feeling, isn’t it? Being so far from home, not knowing if you’ll ever see it again."
    mc "那种感觉很奇妙吧？远离家乡，不知道自己是否还能再见那片天空。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:273
translate chinese hildaintro_7e3d5455:

    # hil "It is. But we adapt. We find ways to survive."
    hil "确实，但总会适应的，我们总会找到活下去的方式。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:275
translate chinese hildaintro_e925ccc3:

    # "Her smile turned bittersweet, and she looked down at her drink."
    "她的笑容泛起一丝苦涩，低头凝视着杯中浮动的光点，仿佛一片破碎的星河在悄然沉浮。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:277
translate chinese hildaintro_f02e3c4f:

    # hil "That’s exactly what I did. When I first started here, it was just for the money. I needed to survive. But over time, I… well, I found a new kind of life here."
    hil "当初我也是这样，刚来这的时候，我只是为了赚钱活下去。但渐渐地……我在这儿找到了另一种生活方式。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:278
translate chinese hildaintro_4f76d9e3:

    # mc "Do you ever wish you could go back?"
    mc "你有没有想过回去？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:280
translate chinese hildaintro_93fa816b:

    # hil "{i}She sighs, her ears drooping slightly{/i} Sometimes. But then I think about the life I’ve built here. The friends I’ve made. It’s not perfect, but it’s mine."
    hil "{i}她轻叹一口气，耳朵微微垂下。{/i}有时候会。这个世界并不完美，但一想到我在这里打拼出来的一切，我就会觉得在这个世界中还有属于我的东西。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:281
translate chinese hildaintro_8def464a:

    # mc "I get it. I really do. It’s hard to know what you want when your past and present are so tangled up. It can be hard to even know who you are sometimes, and it’s scary how easy it can be to forget your past life."
    mc "我懂，当过去和现在纠缠在一起的时候很难拨云见日，有时候甚至会迷失自我，而更可怕的是那些过去其实是很容易被遗忘的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:283
translate chinese hildaintro_0c10309c:

    # hil "It’s nice to have someone who understands, but… you said ‘trapped’ earlier. I wouldn’t use that word."
    hil "有一个懂自己的人真好……不过我不会用‘被困’来形容自己的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:284
translate chinese hildaintro_a8372ad8:

    # hil "I’ve given up trying to repair my ship. It won’t happen in this lifetime. I’ve had to accept that this is just another stage of my life. We all go through stages as we age, through school, then higher education, then work."
    hil "我已经放弃修我的飞船了，我只能接受这只是个新阶段。我们都会经历很多阶段——上学、升学、工作……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:285
translate chinese hildaintro_7c35d636:

    # hil "That people we once knew get left behind, but we persist; we forge ahead, meeting new people and building new connections."
    hil "我们曾认识的人都会被留在曾经，而我们必须前进，结识新人，建立人脉。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:286
translate chinese hildaintro_4afb9489:

    # hil "I realized that if I spent my entire life longing for my previous life, it wouldn’t be living at all. If anything, that’s being trapped."
    hil "后来我意识到，如果我一生都活在对过去的执念里，那根本就不算生活，其实那才是真正的‘被困’。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:287
translate chinese hildaintro_a7a52b80:

    # mc "Shiiiit… You’ve got me dead to rights there… I also can’t stop thinking about ‘home’."
    mc "天哪……你这话真说到我心坎上了，我还是没法不去想‘家’的事。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:288
translate chinese hildaintro_df1a82f6:

    # "[hil] reaches out and touches my shoulder."
    "[hil]伸出手，轻轻搭在我肩上。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:290
translate chinese hildaintro_61262457:

    # hil "Hey… Look around you! This building is practically a temple dedicated to worshipping the moment. Here, people forget their troubles. No egos, no expectations; this is just an environment that reminds you what it means to be alive."
    hil "嘿……看看周围，这栋建筑就像是一座供奉‘当下’的圣殿。人们在这里忘掉烦恼，没有自我，没有预设，只有当下，这才是真正的活着。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:291
translate chinese hildaintro_40f8e182:

    # hil "We all get so caught up in our struggles, work, and drama that we forget that we’re just animals in an incomprehensibly large universe."
    hil "我们总是被各种工作、生活中的琐事缠住，结果忘了去码头整点薯条。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:293
translate chinese hildaintro_5d0b77d3:

    # hil "If I didn’t find a place like this, where I could comfortably switch off my brain, well… honestly, I think I’d have gone crazy."
    hil "要不是找到了这么一个能让我放空大脑的地方，老实说……我早就疯了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:294
translate chinese hildaintro_d55c5cf7:

    # mc "These are some interesting ideas in theory. Easier said to put them into practice."
    mc "这些理论上的想法确实很有趣，但要把它们付诸实践却不容易。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:296
translate chinese hildaintro_02f09010:

    # hil "Hehe, well… I could show you my ideas in practice if you want, with a friendly discount."
    hil "嘿嘿～不过……如果你愿意，我可以亲身实践给你看，还打个友情折扣哦～"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:297
translate chinese hildaintro_188907db:

    # mc "Oh? I think I’d like that a lot."
    mc "哦？我想我非常乐意。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:299
translate chinese hildaintro_ca435875:

    # hil "Me too! I’m usually with female customers, but my tongue doesn’t discriminate~"
    hil "我也是呢！虽然我通常都是接待女客人，但我的舌头可没有偏好～"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:300
translate chinese hildaintro_a7f228b7:

    # hil "My prices for penetration are more expensive, but my pussy is out of this world! {i}Wink{/i}"
    hil "要是做的话价格会高一些啦，但我的小穴可是天外来物哦～{i}抛媚眼{/i}～"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:301
translate chinese hildaintro_1b6a1a5c:

    # "Despite the good points [hil] brought up, I can’t help but wonder if she took them too far and lost sight of herself in the pursuit of happiness."
    "虽然[hil]说的这些话确实有道理，但我不禁怀疑，她是否在追求快乐的道路上走得太远了，迷失自我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:302
translate chinese hildaintro_4707364f:

    # "If I were her, I don’t think I’d ever stop thinking of my original planet. I don’t think I’d ever stop trying to fix my spaceship."
    "设身处地的想想，我大概永远不会停止思念我的故乡，也永远不会放弃修复飞船。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:303
translate chinese hildaintro_a3d6ad71:

    # "And that’s not to say I wouldn’t try and make any friends and start a new life here, but… I don’t know. It’s a lot to unpack."
    "这并不是说我不会试着交朋友，开始新的生活，但……我不清楚了，这实在是太复杂了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:304
translate chinese hildaintro_af6e6d46:

    # "In a way, I can understand what [rub] said about [hil]. ‘Corruption’, in a sense, [hil] been changed by her environment to such a degree that she’s become a different person since she crash-landed here."
    "某种程度上，我能理解[rub]对[hil]的看法。可以说是一种‘堕落’，某种意义上，[hil]多少是被她所在的环境改变了，自从她迫降于此，她已经变了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:305
translate chinese hildaintro_612f0123:

    # "And perhaps it’s a person she never wanted to be, but the person she had to become just to cope with the trauma of being stuck here."
    "也许她从来没想过会变成现在这样，但为了活下去，她别无选择。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:351
translate chinese bastetintro_a61a86e4:

    # "As I approached, I couldn’t shake the feeling I was stepping into a lion’s den. Her gaze met mine, cool and assessing, as if weighing my worth in a single glance."
    "我朝前走去，心里觉得好像自己正走入虎穴。她的目光迎上来，冷静中带着审视，仿佛一眼就能把我看透。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:352
translate chinese bastetintro_468040c3:

    # mc "[bas], right? Mind if I join you?"
    mc "你叫[bas]，对吧？我可以坐一起吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:353
translate chinese bastetintro_83ceb62e:

    # "She didn’t respond immediately, her eyes flicking back to a chessboard that was in front of her. After a moment, she gestured to the seat opposite her with a languid wave of her hand."
    "她没有立刻回应，眼神落回面前那副棋盘。片刻后，她懒洋洋地挥手示意我坐到她对面。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:355
translate chinese bastetintro_cf3b8876:

    # bas "If you think you can keep up."
    bas "你要是跟得上，就坐。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:356
translate chinese bastetintro_1500dd91:

    # "I took a seat, feeling the weight of her scrutiny. The pieces on the board seemed to taunt me."
    "我坐了下来，顿时感到她的审视，棋盘上的棋子似乎在对我冷笑。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:357
translate chinese bastetintro_c8cd3823:

    # mc "[rub] told me you’re unbeaten at chess. But whether I win or lose, I'm honored to play against a princess."
    mc "[rub]说你是棋艺无敌，不过无论输赢，能和一位公主对弈是我的荣幸。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:359
translate chinese bastetintro_b65681d2:

    # "A faint smile curved her lips, a flicker of amusement in her eyes."
    "她嘴角微微勾起，眼中闪过一丝玩味。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:360
translate chinese bastetintro_246f9235:

    # bas "[rub] speaks too freely. But yes, I’ve yet to find a worthy opponent. Let’s see if you’re any different."
    bas "[rub]话太多，不过我还没碰上像样的对手，看看你能不能例外。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:362
translate chinese bastetintro_2082bd38:

    # "Even though my brief game with [pen] revealed that I might not know the rules for this universe’s version of chess, I decided to try anyway."
    "虽然我之前和[pen]下过，但显然这个世界的棋规和我熟悉的不同。即便如此，我还是决定试一试。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:364
translate chinese bastetintro_12011230:

    # "I studied the board, trying to anticipate her moves. She played with calculated grace, each piece moving with multi-layered purpose. As the game progressed, I found myself drawn into her world, the outside noise fading into a distant hum."
    "我仔细观察棋盘，试图预测她的走法。她每一步都优雅且精准，并且都带着多重策略。随着棋局深入，我开始沉浸在其中，连外界的喧嚣也逐渐消退。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:365
translate chinese bastetintro_e53530f0:

    # "There was something about her aloofness. There was more than just a chess game at stake, there was also a challenge to break through the icy façade she wore so effortlessly. Each move on the board felt like a step closer to understanding her."
    "她那种疏离感让我觉得，棋盘上的博弈不只是胜负，更像是一种试探，一次破冰的尝试。每一步，都离她更进一步。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:366
translate chinese bastetintro_2afb0545:

    # "And then, just as I was about to move my knight…"
    "然后，就在我要移动我的马的时候……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:368
translate chinese bastetintro_e363b1d5:

    # bas "No, not there."
    bas "不行。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:369
translate chinese bastetintro_35c3afca:

    # mc "Is this a bad move?"
    mc "那是坏棋？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:371
translate chinese bastetintro_8c337d3c:

    # bas "If you finish that move, I’ll checkmate you in the next seven."
    bas "下了这步，我能七步将死你。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:372
translate chinese bastetintro_be7907a4:

    # "Somewhere bewildered, I leaned back and observed the board… A forced checkmate in seven moves? Can she really see such a thing?"
    "我有些愣住，往后靠了靠，仔细打量棋盘……七步直接将死？她真的能看这么远？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:373
translate chinese bastetintro_75439457:

    # mc "But… how? That’s… amazing. Better than amazing, actually."
    mc "怎、怎么可能……太厉害了，简直是不可思议。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:375
translate chinese bastetintro_a446ef16:

    # "Her eyes narrowed slightly, a glint of interest shining through."
    "她微微偏过视线，眼底悄悄透出一丝兴趣。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:377
translate chinese bastetintro_8ed8a62e:

    # bas "Flattery won’t help you. Now, focus on your next move. If you think you’ve found a good move, stop, and find a better one."
    bas "别拍马屁，专心，你觉得这是好棋？再找更好的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:378
translate chinese bastetintro_5edcc5ea:

    # "I nodded, determined to prove myself. The world around us shrinking as I was fully absorbed in our game, but also, her…"
    "我点点头，心中燃起了要证明自己的念头。周围的一切仿佛都消失了，我只专注于我们的棋局，但同时，她……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:380
translate chinese bastetintro_d364c6e1:

    # "I started to notice the subtle shifts in her demeanor. The way her eyes twitched when she concentrated, the almost imperceptible softening of her expression."
    "我开始察觉她神情中微妙的变化。比如她专注时眼角的一丝轻颤，脸上偶尔流露出些许柔和。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:381
translate chinese bastetintro_98925588:

    # "It sounded simple, it sounded silly, but... she was having fun!"
    "这听起来很简单，也很傻，但是……她正乐在其中！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:382
translate chinese bastetintro_bc539442:

    # mc "You were a princess? That must have been quite a life."
    mc "你曾是一位公主？那一定很不寻常。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:384
translate chinese bastetintro_7ead643c:

    # "A shadow passed over her features, her gaze growing distant. A touchy subject, perhaps?"
    "她的脸上掠过一层阴影，目光随即变得冷淡。也许这是敏感话题？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:386
translate chinese bastetintro_40fdde8e:

    # bas "It was. But that life is gone. Here, I am simply [bas]."
    bas "曾经，可那段人生早已结束，现在，我只是[bas]。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:387
translate chinese bastetintro_051a5834:

    # mc "There’s nothing simple about the way you’re playing me on this board right now."
    mc "可你在棋盘上戏弄我的方式可不只是简单。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:389
translate chinese bastetintro_4fdd1e31:

    # "Her smile returned, more genuine this time."
    "她的笑容再次浮现，这一次，是真心的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:390
translate chinese bastetintro_c72180c2:

    # bas "Yes, I suppose. But even a ‘princess’ can appreciate a challenge."
    bas "是吧，但即便‘公主’也懂欣赏挑战。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:391
translate chinese bastetintro_605c2d25:

    # "The game continued, each move a dance of strategy and wits. I could feel the tension building, but I couldn’t help but notice one of her moves wasn’t as aggressive as it could have been."
    "棋局继续展开，策略与意志在棋盘上翩翩起舞，紧张感逐渐累积，我忽然注意到她有一步棋明显不如预期那般强势。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:392
translate chinese bastetintro_eb0d37cb:

    # "Sure, there could have been plenty of things I couldn’t anticipate, but in that moment, I realized she was going easy on me. No, I don’t think that’s right; what she’s doing is testing me, pushing me to see how far I could go."
