    # mel "Ah- you cheeky little…"
    mel "啊~你这无耻的小……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:766
translate chinese brothel1_610cac20:

    # rub "Having a little verbal spar, I see?"
    rub "打嘴仗打得挺起劲嘛。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:767
translate chinese brothel1_34c63700:

    # "As [rub] intervenes, I notice a lot of people around the club watching us. Seems like we're causing a commotion."
    "[rub]插话时，我才注意到周围俱乐部有不少人都在看我们。看来，我们已经惹出不少动静了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:768
translate chinese brothel1_2e8849ff:

    # mel "Keep a close eye on this one, sis. He only wants to ogle our butts."
    mel "好好盯着他，姐，这家伙天天就盯着我们的屁股看。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:770
translate chinese brothel1_2119f83e:

    # "[mel] walks off – and… Oh!"
    "[mel]走开了——然后……哦！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:776
translate chinese brothel1_d8e0ae8b:

    # "Oh! She gives me a sneaky glimpse of her ass as she passes [rub], which I, of course, admire."
    "哦！当她经过[rub]身边时，她向我偷偷展示了臀部的风景，当然了，大饱眼福。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:777
translate chinese brothel1_e059f7a8:

    # "She’ll probably use this against me later, but I don't care; I'm just glad she's her usual fun self."
    "她大概之后会拿这事来调侃我，但我不在乎，我很高兴她还是跟以前一样，爱玩，爱闹。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:778
translate chinese brothel1_e43c7ed6:

    # "Though... something seemed off about her face, like dark makeup around her eyes that's slightly obscured by tufts of fur."
    "尽管……她的脸似乎有些不对劲，眼周像是涂了很重的黑眼影，略被毛发遮住，看上去有点怪。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:784
translate chinese brothel1_3816fce8:

    # rub "First time here, isn't it? Apologies for that, darling."
    rub "第一次来？别在意她那样，亲爱的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:785
translate chinese brothel1_e569a018:

    # mc "Yeah, don’t worry, I’m used to people like that."
    mc "没事，我早习惯那样了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:787
translate chinese brothel1_372b4a83:

    # rub "[mel] only works here when she feels like it, offering arguments and insults, as she puts it."
    rub "[mel]只在她心情好时才会来这儿工作，用她自己的话来说，她是来提供争吵和毒舌服务的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:788
translate chinese brothel1_f55aef22:

    # mc "She… works here? In the brothel?"
    mc "她…在这里工作？在这家妓院？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:790
translate chinese brothel1_1af6884f:

    # rub "Ah, this isn't a brothel solely for physical pursuits but for intellectual ones too. It's a brothel of intellectual curiosities and mental stimulation."
    rub "啊，这里可不只是肉体的欢愉之所，更是智慧与欲望交织的殿堂。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:791
translate chinese brothel1_23c92e13:

    # rub "Each host here offers a distinct experience—some of the flesh, yes, but others of the mind. For instance, an adventurer with a photographic memory who exchanges stories, or an extremely affectionate dog girl."
    rub "每位接待者都提供一种独特的体验——有些确实是肉体上的，但也有些是心智层面的。比如一个过目不忘的冒险家为你讲述旅途故事，或者一个非常深情的犬娘。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:793
translate chinese brothel1_69a99421:

    # rub "[mel]… she doesn’t actually work here. She just enjoys the free drinks, I guess."
    rub "[mel]……她其实并不在这儿工作，我猜她只是喜欢这里的免费酒水。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:802
translate chinese rub1m_e3be9b5a:

    # rub "Reminding me of that… You’re making me nostalgic."
    rub "这让我不禁想起从前……你让我有些怀念起过去了呢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:803
translate chinese rub1m_5d4d59ba:

    # rub "That was my first dream, but trying to run a clothing shop in a society like this just didn’t make financial sense. Large expenses led to the closure of the business."
    rub "那是我最初的梦想，但在这种社会环境下，开一家服装店根本不现实，巨额的开销让这项生意无以为继。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:808
translate chinese rub1m_650d9602:

    # rub "Heard of that, did you? I seldom did that once upon a time; the resulting funds were enough for me to start what you see today."
    rub "你听说了是吧？我此前做过几次，所得的资金足够让我开启今天你看到的这一切。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:809
translate chinese rub1m_50b2de61:

    # rub "While I don’t participate in the sex industry anymore, but I don’t regret my time as a model."
    rub "我现在虽然已经不再涉足性产业，但我并不后悔我在摄像头前的那段时光。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:814
translate chinese rub1m_6d490625:

    # rub "I like to consider this world as one of experiences. I desire to experience as much of this world as I can before I pass on."
    rub "我喜欢将这个世界视为一种体验。我希望在撒手人寰前尽可能多地去享受这个世界。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:815
translate chinese rub1m_5fabb03d:

    # rub "This desire was sparked after the failure of my boutique. Spending so many years working on it, only for it to fail, was both a profound and sobering moment for me."
    rub "这种渴望是在我的精品店倒闭之后被点燃的。花了数年时间致力于此，结果却失败了，那是一段既沉重又深刻的经历。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:816
translate chinese rub1m_0f3dd1b3:

    # rub "I realized there was more to life, and hence I began a social club."
    rub "我意识到生命的意义远不止于此，因此我开了个社交俱乐部。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:817
translate chinese rub1m_4a06e54a:

    # rub "Using my business acumen, it evolved under my leadership over a decade into what it is today."
    rub "凭借我的商业头脑，它在我领导下逐渐发展十年成为了今天的模样。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:822
translate chinese rub1m_30fc18f8:

    # rub "Enough about us, you seem like an intriguing fellow, and you seem to know quite a lot about me."
    rub "关于我们的事情已经说的够多了，你看起来是个有趣的家伙，似乎对我了解还不少。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:823
translate chinese rub1m_dc8af94d:

    # mc "Where do I even begin…"
    mc "该从何说起呢……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:824
translate chinese rub1m_e0524450:

    # "I give [rub] a brief rundown of how I’m trying to recreate the Virtues of Concord to protect this world, and they were a powerful group from my own universe. She doesn’t need all the details now; she can learn as we go."
    "我简要向[rub]介绍了自己正在努力重建Virtues of Concord的事，她们原本是我所在宇宙里极具力量的团队，现在不需要一次讲完细节，她可以在过程中慢慢了解。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:825
translate chinese rub1m_df689b31:

    # "Thankfully, she doesn't balk at the idea that I'm from another universe. She accepts it with a polite sip of wine."
    "值得庆幸的，她并没有拒绝我来自另外一个宇宙的说法，只是优雅地抿了一口酒，接受了这个事实。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:827
translate chinese rub1m_dcaff15e:

    # rub "Now that’s quite the story."
    rub "这故事可真不简单。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:828
translate chinese rub1m_219da995:

    # mc "Let’s just say, I have quite an experience to offer you. How would you like to meet the Queen?"
    mc "这么说吧，我能为你提供段难忘的经历，想见女王吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:830
translate chinese rub1m_9c77e044:

    # rub "Fuhuhu, one doesn’t simply walk into an establishment and hand such a thing out at random. Tell me, why do I deserve such an honor specifically?"
    rub "哈哈哈，没人会简单的走进一家妓院白送这种事的，说吧，你的条件是什么？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:831
translate chinese rub1m_a1b82554:

    # "A surprisingly challenging question. Why do the virtues need to be the exact same six girls in every reality? They don’t, which is as much as [rub] is indirectly implying."
    "这问题出乎意料地难回答，为什么virtues必须在每个世界里都是同样的六个雌驹？并不一定如此，正如 [rub] 所暗示的那样。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:833
translate chinese rub1m_11b32b5e:

    # rub "I’d really love to discuss this further, darling, but I am swamped with work right now. However, I ask that you instead talk to the other ladies at the brothel and learn from them."
    rub "我真的想进一步讨论这个，亲爱的，但我现在真的忙得不可开交。不如这样，你先去和本店的其他小姐们聊聊，向她们学习一些东西。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:834
translate chinese rub1m_aa2ff93e:

    # rub "Once you feel like you’re ready, come back and tell me what you’ve learned."
    rub "等你觉得准备好了，再回来告诉我，你都学到了什么。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:836
translate chinese rub1m_8ad65dc9:

    # "[rub] takes off before I have time to think through a reply. Just what exactly is she expecting me to learn?"
    "[rub] 在我来得及想清楚回复前就匆匆离开了。我忍不住想，她到底希望我学到什么？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:838
translate chinese rub1m_8ffdffa3:

    # "I take the opportunity to familiarize myself with the building. In addition to the sitting area, there's a bar over here, and there also seems to be a private area veiled behind curtains. Pretty obvious what happens behind there."
    "我借此机会熟悉了一下这个建筑物，除了大厅，还有一个酒吧区，似乎还有一个隐藏在帘子后面的私密区域，这些帘子后面干什么的很明显。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:840
translate chinese rub1m_b719ec4f:

    # mel "Can you hear those broads moaning? It’s half the reason we have music here. Can’t believe that kind of thing is happening in my home."
    mel "听见那些婊子的呻吟声了吗？这儿放音乐有一半原因就是为了这个，不敢相信这种事发生在我家。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:841
translate chinese rub1m_8c72595c:

    # mc "Hey again, [mel], where did you sneak off to?"
    mc "又见面了，[mel]，你刚刚躲哪去了？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:843
translate chinese rub1m_10ffaceb:

    # mel "The bar. The booze makes this all a little more bearable."
    mel "那个吧台，酒让一切都好受些。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:844
translate chinese rub1m_bd1b852d:

    # "She holds out two drinks — pink glittery cocktails that fade into swirls of deeper purple at the bottom of the tall glass."
    "她递来两杯酒——粉红色闪闪发光的鸡尾酒，杯底漾着深紫色的旋涡。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:846
translate chinese rub1m_4f33c2ac:

    # mel "Forget my sister’s dumb idea, you’re too good for this lot. Come talk with me instead."
    mel "别听我姐那一套，你和她们根本不是一路人。来，跟我聊聊吧。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:847
translate chinese rub1m_1e231aa6:

    # "If I want to convince [rub] to help me, getting on [mel]'s good side will help significantly."
    "如果我想说服[rub]帮助我，拉拢[mel]将会有很大的帮助。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:851
translate chinese rub1m_9e95449b:

    # "[mel] leads me to a selection of private cubicles. Intimate sanctuaries that can be closed off by a curtain."
    "[mel]把我领到一个私人隔间——可以用帘子封起来的私密领域。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:852
translate chinese rub1m_52aca135:

    # "Inside, we sit on either side of the room, but still pretty close to each other. The seats were plush and soft, with ambient lighting inviting relaxation."
    "我们分别坐在隔间的两边，但其实距离很近，柔软的座椅和昏黄的灯光营造出一种放松的氛围。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:853
translate chinese rub1m_c0dc9f32:

    # "We quietly sip on our drinks before she speaks up first."
    "我们静静地喝着酒，直到她先开口。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:856
translate chinese rub1m_5b00616c:

    # mel "Surprising to see a man in here."
    mel "在这儿看到个男的还真稀奇。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:857
translate chinese rub1m_bcbf976c:

    # mel "You could be gross and perverted like any other geezer, but you don’t seem to carry yourself like the others… There’s no ego or expectation surrounding you."
    mel "你可能会像其他怪胎一样油腻、变态……但你看上去和他们不一样……你身上没有自以为是或非分之想。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:858
translate chinese rub1m_34d4813f:

    # mc "Yeah, I’m gross and perverted, but aren’t we all?"
    mc "是啊，我是又油腻又变态，但我们不都这样吗?"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:860
translate chinese rub1m_bd67f9a1:

    # mel "Nuh-uh, I’m pure. Such a dirty thought could never enter my pristine mind palace. Unlike you, greedily eyeing up my ass."
    mel "哼，我纯洁的很。这种肮脏的想法永远不会进入我纯洁的心灵。不像你，眼睛都快贴我屁股上了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:861
translate chinese rub1m_6abcdeea:

    # mc "Pfft, as if you weren’t tilting so I could get a better view."
    mc "得了吧，你刚刚还故意扭身子让我看得更清楚。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:863
translate chinese rub1m_8e3f9565:

    # mel "We’re all nude here; it’s impolite to stare like that~"
    mel "我们都光着，那样盯着看多不礼貌~"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:864
translate chinese rub1m_537717cf:

    # mc "Speaking of your body, though…"
    mc "说到你的身体……"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:865
translate chinese rub1m_2e1b4cf9:

    # "I finally figured out what those markings on her body are: metallic seams."
    "我终于弄明白了她身上的那些花纹：金属接缝。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:867
translate chinese rub1m_6be8864b:

    # mel "Stop making comments on my body, you lech. I’m not going to sleep with you."
    mel "别再盯着我身体品头论足了，色鬼，我是不会跟你上床的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:868
translate chinese rub1m_f9c9c3b1:

    # mc "I’m just curious why you seem to have metal augmentations?"
    mc "我只是好奇，你为什么会有金属植入体？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:870
translate chinese rub1m_fb5ccc78:

    # mel "Eugh, do you have any idea how bored I am with that conversation? Why can’t someone just accept my body and not ask their inane questions."
    mel "够了，你知道我有多烦这话题吗？就不能有人单纯接受我的身体，不问那些蠢问题吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:871
translate chinese rub1m_35c331a9:

    # mc "You don’t have to tell me, then. I’m just happy you’re alright."
    mc "你不说也没关系，我只是很高兴你没事。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:873
translate chinese rub1m_ad932a98:

    # "I return to sipping my cocktail, only to look back up and realize that [mel] was staring at me in pleasant disbelief."
    "我又抿了抿我的鸡尾酒，一回头发现 [mel] 正以愉悦而难以置信的目光盯着我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:874
translate chinese rub1m_2905cf8c:

    # mel "I, uh… It was an incident. A lot of me is cybernetic now. The details are a story I don’t tell to anyone."
    mel "我，呃……那是场意外。现在我身上很多地方都是义体，细节我不会告诉任何人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:875
translate chinese rub1m_1c688315:

    # mel "It really put [rub] in a difficult financial situation… It’s the real reason she started this ‘strip club’ instead of following her dream of a boutique."
    mel "这事让[rub]陷入了极大的经济困境……这就是她创办这个“脱衣舞俱乐部”的原因，而不是去追求她原本梦想的精品店。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:877
translate chinese rub1m_d443b95b:

    # mel "{i}Sigh{/i} She’s so stupid… Doesn’t she understand how awful that makes me feel?"
    mel "{i}诶{/i} 她真的太傻了……她怎么就不明白这让我有多愧疚？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:878
translate chinese rub1m_1b77c219:

    # mel "And even though she did it for me, I can’t help but resent her for degrading herself like this. If it wasn't for me, she could be a fashion designer right now!"
    mel "她是为了我才这么做的……可我还是无法原谅她像这样侮辱自己。如果没有我，她早就成为一名时装设计师了！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:879
translate chinese rub1m_12199b29:

    # mc "You shouldn't blame-"
    mc "你不该责——"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:881
translate chinese rub1m_49f73ae3:

    # mel "Don't tell me I shouldn't blame myself! Empty sympathies from a stranger don't mean shit."
    mel "别告诉我该不该自责！来自陌生人那空洞无物的同情跟放屁一样。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:882
translate chinese rub1m_eff7ee8b:

    # mc "Hm, in that case, I’m curious, how much of you is robotic?"
    mc "嗯，既然如此，我很好奇，你的身体到底有多少是机械的？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:883
translate chinese rub1m_409bd2f4:

    # mel "It’s more than it looks, and it already looks like a lot... Approximately 50%% of my body is currently mechanical."
    mel "这比看起来的要多，而且这看起来已经有很多了...现在我身体大约有50%%是机械的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:884
translate chinese rub1m_b7eaf56f:

    # mc "Is it possible for you to get a variety of parts, then?"
    mc "那你可以选各种不同的部件吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:885
translate chinese rub1m_56046a7b:

    # mel "A ‘variety’? What do you mean?"
    mel "‘各种’？你指什么？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:886
translate chinese rub1m_72896972:

    # mc "Like, different colors, or alternative features."
    mc "比如不同的颜色，或者各种功能之类的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:888
translate chinese rub1m_cb3656fc:

    # mel "Pfft, do you hate my tiny tits that much? You are correct, though, I could –"
    mel "噗，你那么讨厌我的小奶子吗？不过你是对的，我可以—"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:890
translate chinese rub1m_30e74099:

    # mel "Wait a second… You just implied you know what I looked like before the incident... that and my name... Who the hell are you?"
    mel "等等……你刚才那句话……你暗示你知道我在事故发生之前的样子？你还知道我的名字……你他妈到底是谁？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:892
translate chinese rub1m_e73f2f21:

    # mel "No, no, I don’t even want to know."
    mel "不，不对，我不想知道。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:893
translate chinese rub1m_87d9f72d:

    # mc "Really? I'd tell you."
    mc "真的？我可以告诉你哦。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:895
translate chinese rub1m_c6efe20e:

    # mel "Even though I could get a larger rack, or a new set of enhanced legs, it’s something I’m very ideologically against."
    mel "虽然我可以换个巨乳，或者来一套新强化腿什么的，但我打心底反对这么做。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:900
translate chinese rub1m_c4ba293a:

    # mel "Pfft, sure, if I had such a small pecker, I’d want to augment it too."
    mel "哼，当然，如果我有那么小的老二，我也想增大它。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:901
translate chinese rub1m_27ea30dd:

    # mc "You haven’t seen anything yet. It {i}does{/i} get bigger."
    mc "你还没见识过呢。它 {i} 确实{/i} 可以变得很大。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:903
translate chinese rub1m_19bcb7cb:

    # mel "Ahaha, sure, buddy."
    mel "哈哈，好啦，好啦，嘴上说谁不会。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:904
translate chinese rub1m_f55a5276:

    # mel "I’ll stick to what I have. I don’t want to forget myself."
    mel "我会坚持我的看法，我不想失去自我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:907
translate chinese rub1m_7338a1da:

    # mel "Exactly! This exact package is me, and I don’t want to forget that."
    mel "确实！我才是关键所在，不能忘记这一点。"

