    # rub "We unicorns trace our lineage back to wild horses. Even now, they gather in groups called 'harems'—a dominant stallion, several mares, and their young."
    rub "我们独角兽的族谱可以追溯至野马。至今他们仍以“后宫”的形式聚集——由一匹主导种马、几匹雌驹及幼驹组成。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2796
translate chinese brothel3_5d180c1a:

    # mc "But that evolution happened millions of years ago. Wouldn't there be some divergence?"
    mc "但那是数百万年前的进化了。难道没有出现一些分化吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2798
translate chinese brothel3_1b709dd0:

    # rub "Perhaps. The world has shifted considerably. We now graze in supermarkets rather than fields."
    rub "或许吧。世界已经大变样了。现在我们在超市觅食而非草原。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2799
translate chinese brothel3_d6df9f75:

    # rub "Still, much of our biology harkens back to those wild horses. They had robust genes that proved themselves through the ages and persist in various forms across species."
    rub "但我们的生物特性大多仍溯源自那些野马。它们拥有历经时间考验的强大基因，并以各种形式延续存在。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2801
translate chinese brothel3_af3f13ef:

    # rub "Yet as society and culture have evolved, so have our needs. The wild stallion’s vigilance and strength are no longer the concerns of the modern world."
    rub "但随着社会文化演进，我们的需求也变了。野马的警觉性与力量不再是现代世界的关切点。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2802
translate chinese brothel3_0449b285:

    # rub "Ladies today have different needs, and in a way that’s almost humorous, you’re the contemporary ideal for many of them."
    rub "如今的女士们需求不同，而幽默地说，你反而成了许多人心中的当代理想型。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2803
translate chinese brothel3_e790209e:

    # mc "Is that why multiple ladies flock to a single guy?"
    mc "所以多位女性会聚集在同一个男性身边？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2805
translate chinese brothel3_2bdeb64c:

    # rub "Consider this: in the pony world, about 75%% of the population are mares, leaving an average of three mares for every stallion."
    rub "想想看：在小马的世界里，大约75%%的马口是雌驹，平均每匹雄驹对应三匹雌驹。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2806
translate chinese brothel3_0b630c60:

    # mc "Yep. It sounds way easier for the guys."
    mc "是啊。听起来雄性轻松多了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2808
translate chinese brothel3_1778ca95:

    # rub "Indeed, seeing one stallion with two or three partners isn’t out of the ordinary. It’s crucial, too, because if we only had ‘couples,’ that’d mean, at most, only half of our population would breed."
    rub "确实，见到一匹种马拥有两三位伴侣并不稀奇。这也很关键——因为如果我们遵守一夫一妻制，那意味着至多只有一半种群能繁殖。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2809
translate chinese brothel3_ea2e5dd7:

    # mc "Ah, harems aren’t merely cultural artifacts; they’re a biological necessity."
    mc "啊，后宫不仅是文化产物，更是生物学上的必需品。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2811
translate chinese brothel3_93b7c306:

    # rub "Correct. And that’s why mares, as a species, possess a certain weakness."
    rub "正确。因此雌驹作为物种存在某种弱点。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2812
translate chinese brothel3_67793187:

    # mc "A weakness?"
    mc "弱点？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2814
translate chinese brothel3_74e49711:

    # rub "When we ladies see a high-value partner, we fall for them hard."
    rub "当我们女性看到高价值伴侣时，会轻易沦陷。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2815
translate chinese brothel3_eb1f6224:

    # rub "You needn’t worry about letting us down or feeling overwhelmed by balancing so many partners. These are partnerships of mutual responsibility, so when you’re low, it’s our duty to lift you up."
    rub "你不必担心让我们失望或因平衡多位伴侣而疲惫。这些都是共同责任的关系，当你情绪低落时，我们有责任让你振作起来。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2816
translate chinese brothel3_fc838a3b:

    # mc "Heh, you see what I mean, though, right? You girls really are remarkable."
    mc "呵呵，明白我的意思了吧？你们这些女孩们确实了不起。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2817
translate chinese brothel3_fa7e09c4:

    # mc "Truth is, I’d be nothing without mares like you. You’re all so impressive—business owners, masters of your crafts, homeowners—and then there’s me… a homeless guy leaning on your support."
    mc "说实话，没有你们这样的雌驹我什么都不是。你们个个都那么出色——企业家、行业精英、有房一族——再看看我…只是个靠着你们帮助的无家可归的人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2819
translate chinese brothel3_79864d3d:

    # rub "Despite that, you’re the key."
    rub "可即便如此，你才是最关键的人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2820
translate chinese brothel3_8f4e2fe4:

    # mc "Shouldn’t it be the other way around? Wouldn’t a successful alpha with wealth and power be a better fit for a harem?"
    mc "难道不该反过来吗？一个拥有财富和权力的成功领袖不是更适合组建这样的关系吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2822
translate chinese brothel3_ab0763a0:

    # rub "You don’t have to be some growling, prowling ‘alpha’ to win our favor. All you need to do is be the one who brings us to our true potential and then binds us together."
    rub "你不需要成为那种虚张声势的“领袖”来赢得我们青睐。你只需做到：激发我们真正的潜力，再将我们紧密相连。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2823
translate chinese brothel3_3cf14822:

    # rub "Everywhere you go, you leave a path of light in this encroaching darkness. You can’t blame us for wanting to follow you, can you?"
    rub "无论你去往何处，都会在渐深的黑暗中留下光的轨迹。你总不能怪我们想追随这道光吧？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2825
translate chinese brothel3_168aaa07:

    # rub "And... that is the long answer for why I'm okay with you dating my sister."
    rub "而…这就是为什么我同意你和我妹妹交往的详细原因。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2826
translate chinese brothel3_3f285db3:

    # mc "If it’s any comfort, she made me work hard for it."
    mc "如果这能让你好受些，她确实让我费了好大功夫才争取到。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2828
translate chinese brothel3_c5263bb7:

    # rub "Fuhuhu, I can imagine. I was quite the teasing minx myself back in the day."
    rub "呵呵，我能想象。我年轻时也挺爱捉弄人的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2829
translate chinese brothel3_289e0f4c:

    # mc "{i}Really{/i}? I couldn’t imagine that!"
    mc "{i} 真的吗 {/i}？完全看不出来呢！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2831
translate chinese brothel3_37db7949:

    # rub "She’ll soften with time, though it seems you’ve already tamed the wild mare, haven’t you? Never thought I’d see that day."
    rub "她会慢慢变得柔和的，不过看来你已经驯服了这匹野马，对吧？真没想到我能亲眼见到这一天。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2838
translate chinese brothel3_a339cdbd:

    # mel "Even if you are a big loser!"
    mel "就算你确实是个没出息的家伙！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2839
translate chinese brothel3_517d0c9a:

    # "[mel] stepped in with a towel, her fur damp and messy."
    "[mel]拿着毛巾走过来，皮毛湿漉漉的有些凌乱。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2841
translate chinese brothel3_7eaded8c:

    # "I couldn’t help but laugh as I glanced over at [mel], then back to [rub]. They’ve both come to mean so much to me."
    "我忍不住笑起来，目光从[mel]转向[rub]。她们俩对我而言都变得如此重要。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2842
translate chinese brothel3_013e05e0:

    # "It was strange, despite this being another universe, I felt like I belonged here, with them…"
    "虽然身处另一个宇宙很奇妙，但我觉得自己就该和她们在一起…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2843
translate chinese brothel3_16733251:

    # mc "Well, if being a loser means I get to stay with you two, I suppose it’s not such a bad deal after all."
    mc "好吧，如果当个没出息的家伙就能和你们在一起，看来这买卖也不算亏。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2845
translate chinese brothel3_2eeb7a0a:

    # rub "That’s the spirit. Besides, ‘alpha’ is just a label. Action is what counts. You accomplish more than you realize."
    rub "这么想就对了。何况“领袖”不过是个标签，行动才说明一切。你做到的远比你自己意识到的要多。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2847
translate chinese brothel3_8cee11a4:

    # mel "{i}Giggle{/i} Yeah, but don’t let it go to your head. We’ve got enough egos in this brothel already."
    mel "{i} 呵呵 {/i}是啊，但可别因此得意忘形。我们这儿自负的人已经够多了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2849
translate chinese brothel3_5810e5e1:

    # "As more laughter and chatter continued to fill the room, they chased away the last of my doubts."
    "随着欢笑声和谈话声持续充满房间，她们彻底驱散了我最后的疑虑。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2851
translate chinese brothel3_6ec75242:

    # "We said our goodbyes and I left the brothel. Stepping outside, I breathed in the cool, crisp air and began to walk back to the apartment."
    "我们互相道别后，我离开了妓院。走到室外，我深吸一口清凉的空气，开始往公寓走去。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2856
translate chinese brothel3_e638e368:

    # mox "Well, hey there, stranger! Been a long night?"
    mox "哟，陌生人！今晚忙到这么晚啊？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2857
translate chinese brothel3_bfbdca79:

    # mc "You could say that. Every night in the brothel feels long, but I’m not even the least bit tired."
    mc "可以这么说。妓院的每个夜晚都感觉很漫长，但我却一点也不觉得累。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2859
translate chinese brothel3_65a3811e:

    # mox "Oh? Spill the gossip!"
    mox "哦？快说说有什么八卦！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2860
translate chinese brothel3_6f5394c4:

    # mc "For starters, [mel] confessed how she felt about me. It’s something I think we both knew was there, but tonight she finally said it out loud. One thing led to another."
    mc "首先，[mel]坦白了对我的感觉。我觉得我们双方都心知肚明的事，今晚她终于说出口了。然后事情就顺其自然地发展啦。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2862
translate chinese brothel3_547da2f8:

    # mox "First me, then [rub], then [mel] too! She wasn’t even on your original hit-it list. I don’t know how you keep up!"
    mox "先是我，接着[rub]，现在连[mel]也沦陷了！她原本根本不在你的目标清单上呢。真不知道你怎么应付过来的！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2863
translate chinese brothel3_ccb58ece:

    # mc "Yup, I’m still trying to wrap my head around it all. I mean, how did I get so lucky? How did a guy like me end up surrounded by so many amazing people? … Twice."
    mc "是啊，我到现在还觉得难以置信。怎么说呢，我怎么就这么幸运？像我这样的人，怎么会遇到这么多美好的人？…还发生了两次。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2865
translate chinese brothel3_969c5c1e:

    # mox "Luck’s got nothing to do with it, [mc]. You’ve earned this by being who you are. That’s all we ever really want."
    mox "这和运气无关，[mc]。做真实的自己就是你赢得这一切的原因。这才是我们真正想要的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2866
translate chinese brothel3_bd2ea716:

    # "She leaned in, planting a gentle kiss on my cheek."
    "她靠过来，在我脸颊轻轻印下一个吻。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2867
translate chinese brothel3_b7d405d7:

    # mc "Thanks again, [mox]. I couldn’t do this without you."
    mc "再次感谢，[mox]。没有你我不可能做到这些。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2869
translate chinese brothel3_07924da2:

    # mox "You’re doing just fine, [mc]. And no matter what, we’re all in this together. That’s the beauty of it."
    mox "你做得很好，[mc]。无论如何我们都会共同面对。这才是最美好的部分。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2870
translate chinese brothel3_fe255e8e:

    # "It wasn’t about what I had or lacked, what I’d done or hadn’t done. It was about the bonds I’d forged, the people who stood by me, and how I’d once again found my place in their lives."
    "重要的不是我拥有或缺少什么，也不是我做过或没做过什么。而是我建立的羁绊，那些支持我的人们，以及我如何再次在她们生命中找到了自己的位置。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2871
translate chinese brothel3_2f873453:

    # "As the night drew to a close, I realized I had a new purpose. No longer would I be the man adrift in another universe, haunted by his past."
    "当夜幕渐深，我意识到自己有了新的目标。不再是那个在另一个宇宙漂泊、被往事所纠缠的人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2872
translate chinese brothel3_5bf9a256:

    # "Whether I could return to my old world or not, the priority now was to anchor myself to this reality."
    "无论能否回到原来的世界，现在的首要任务是让自己扎根于这个现实。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2883
translate chinese brothel4_b709882d:

    # "The brothel was really alive today."
    "今天妓院真是充满生机呢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2884
translate chinese brothel4_cf54be02:

    # "Music pulsed through my chest as I pushed through the crowd in search of the girls that invited me here today."
    "音乐震动着我的胸腔，我挤过人群寻找今天邀请我来这儿的女孩们。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2885
translate chinese brothel4_fb816adb:

    # "I scanned the room, searching for [mel]. Her bright white fur coat is always easy to spot at times like this."
    "我扫视整个房间寻找[mel]。她亮白色的毛发在这种场合总是很显眼。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2886
translate chinese brothel4_0a9b0e4d:

    # "And there they are – three ladies reunited at last."
    "她们在那儿——三位女孩终于重聚了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2888
translate chinese brothel4_2767a08f:

    # "[mel] sat at the head of the table, an elbow propped lazily on the surface, signature smirk firmly in place."
    "[mel]坐在桌首，手肘懒散地撑在桌面上，标志性的得意笑容稳稳挂在脸上。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2891
translate chinese brothel4_a4be832a:

    # "[sky] leaned forward, gesturing animatedly as she spoke. Her energy rubbing off on the others."
    "[sky]兴奋地前倾身体，说话时手势不断。她的活力感染了其他人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2894
translate chinese brothel4_e42ae1e6:

    # "[blo] was the reserved one, but she was at complete comfort and constantly contributing to the conversation."
    "[blo]虽然比较内向，但显得完全放松，并且持续为对话贡献内容。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2896
translate chinese brothel4_f5fdfdd6:

    # mel "You made it! I was starting to think you chickened out!"
    mel "你终于来了！我还以为你临阵退缩了呢！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2897
translate chinese brothel4_002152ef:

    # mc "Couldn’t miss the historic reunion, could I?"
    mc "这么历史性的重聚时刻，我怎么能错过呢？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2899
translate chinese brothel4_f1654a2d:

    # mel "Historic, huh? You make it sound like we’re world leaders signing a treaty or something."
    mel "历史性？说得好像我们是签署条约的世界领导人似的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2900
translate chinese brothel4_20e864ce:

    # mc "Sure! The ‘Carefree Mischief Committee’ is finally back together."
    mc "当然！\"无忧无虑恶作剧委员会\"终于重聚了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2902
translate chinese brothel4_7b11a5c6:

    # blo "That has a nice ring to it."
    blo "这名字听起来挺有意思的。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2904
translate chinese brothel4_6568e0ac:

    # sky "Guess that makes you the president or something, huh, [mel]?"
    sky "那看来你就是总统之类的了，对吧，[mel]？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2906
translate chinese brothel4_5404d8e1:

    # mel "Me?! I mean, obviously~ … But why me?"
    mel "我？！嗯，确实该是我呢~…不过为什么选我呀？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2908
translate chinese brothel4_527b464a:

    # sky "[mel], you’re half robot and running a brothel! Easily the most qualified."
    sky "[mel]，你既是半机械人又经营着妓院！显然是最合适的人选。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2910
translate chinese brothel4_60b604d9:

    # mel "Heh, I’m not running shit. I’m {i}training{/i} to run it with my sister."
    mel "呵呵，我才没管什么事呢。现在正{i} 跟着姐姐学习 {/i}怎么管理。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2912
translate chinese brothel4_f3e69867:

    # blo "And you’re just deflecting, [sky], you have the best career out of all of us. A famous athlete with [rik]!"
    blo "你明明在转移话题，[sky]！你的职业生涯可是我们中最成功的，和[rik]一起成了著名运动员呢！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2914
translate chinese brothel4_f1f883c5:

    # sky "Pfftt, all that only to work as a trainer in a gym. Not that I don’t love it."
    sky "噗，折腾了这么久最后在健身房当教练。虽然我确实挺喜欢这工作啦。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2916
translate chinese brothel4_287a2bb5:

    # mel "Hmm... all three of us have a connection to one of those ‘virtues’? [rub], [hon], and [rik]."
    mel "嗯…我们三个都正好对应哪几种\"美德\"？[rub]，[hon]和[rik]。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2918
translate chinese brothel4_4f67e960:

    # mel "Mr. Mediator, how do you fit into all this? You’re always pulling strings with your alternative universe knowledge."
    mel "调解员先生，你在这其中又扮演什么角色呢？总是用那些平行宇宙的知识在幕后推动着一切。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2919
translate chinese brothel4_039ef087:

    # mc "Me? You’re overthinking it. I’m just here to make sure you don’t scare [blo] off!"
    mc "我？你想多啦。我在这儿就是防止你们把[blo]吓跑而已！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2921
translate chinese brothel4_1978bb6f:

    # blo "Ahaha, I’m fine! [mel] is much nicer to me than she is to you!"
    blo "啊哈哈，我没事！[mel]对我可比对你们温柔多啦！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2922
translate chinese brothel4_32e1ed57:

    # mc "Ain’t that the truth."
    mc "这倒是实话。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2924
translate chinese brothel4_ded5673a:

    # mel "Awhh, isn’t [blo] so lovely? Unlike {i}some{/i} people!"
    mel "哇，[blo]是不是特别可爱？可不像{i} 某些 {/i}人呢！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2926
translate chinese brothel4_3a48cd65:

    # sky "Now that we’re all together, I’d like for us to stay together!"
    sky "既然现在大家都聚在一起，我真希望我们能一直这样！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2928
translate chinese brothel4_3a6877b3:

    # blo "Great idea! Why don’t we create a group chat to keep in touch?"
    blo "好主意！不如建个群聊方便保持联系？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2930
translate chinese brothel4_96686451:

    # mel "I'll call it the ‘Carefree Mischief Committee,’ we can use it to plan future mischief!"
    mel "群名就叫\"无忧无虑恶作剧委员会\"吧，以后可以用来策划各种有趣的恶作剧！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2931
translate chinese brothel4_f7bad552:

    # "[mel] pulls out her phone and starts creating the chat. The three girls are quickly in, and they begin typing enthusiastically."
    "[mel]掏出手机开始建群。三个女孩迅速加入，兴致勃勃地开始输入消息。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2932
translate chinese brothel4_1dcfb0d1:

    # "I sit back satisfied for being able to play a part in reuniting these personalities."
    "我满意地靠向椅背，很高兴自己能促成这次重聚。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2933
translate chinese brothel4_4a79cb20:

    # "Evidently, my job was done as the girls dive into texting, momentarily overlooking me as they share their thoughts and plans in the new group chat."
    "显然我的任务已经完成了，女孩们专注地发着消息，在新群里热烈交流着想法和计划，暂时忘了我的存在。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2934
translate chinese brothel4_55ddec78:

    # "However, [mel] who sits beside me, doesn’t hide her screen at all, letting me catch a glimpse of what they’re really talking about."
    "不过坐在旁边的[mel]完全没遮挡屏幕，让我瞥见了她们真实的聊天内容。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2935
translate chinese brothel4_b659b2a6:

    # "Each of the girls are admitting and discussing their intimate experiences with me!"
    "每个女孩都在坦白并讨论她们与我的亲密经历！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2936
translate chinese brothel4_625b27e7:

    # "Their facial expressions slowly shift from excitement to something more mischievous."
    "她们脸上的表情渐渐从兴奋转成了带着淘气的神色。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2938
translate chinese brothel4_be94ce92:

    # sky "Heh, we’ve got our very own stud!"
    sky "嘿，我们可是有专属的种马呢！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2939
translate chinese brothel4_d3950ce3:

    # sky "Who knows where I’d be if he didn’t help mediate my relationship with [rik] after we fell out. Since I met him, my life’s been on the up-and-up."
    sky "要不是他在我和[rik]闹翻后帮忙调解，真不知道我会变成什么样。自从遇见他，我的生活就越来越好了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2940
translate chinese brothel4_68359c21:

    # mc "I think you’d always bounce back up, [sky], nothing could bring you down."
    mc "我觉得你总能重新振作起来的，[sky]，没什么能真正击垮你。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2942
translate chinese brothel4_b27ee6d2:

    # sky "And yet, never as high without you."
    sky "但如果没有你，我永远达不到现在的高度。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2944
translate chinese brothel4_d1ed6e1a:

    # mel "And I thought we had something special~ He helped pull me out of a depression, but it was more than just that… He was one of the most genuine people I’d ever met, and my thorns didn’t push him away."
    mel "我还以为我们之间很特别呢~他确实帮我走出了消沉，但不止如此…他是我见过最真诚的人，连我的尖刺都没能吓跑他。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2945
translate chinese brothel4_5b353903:

    # mc "I love those thorns."
    mc "我就喜欢那些尖刺。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2947
translate chinese brothel4_0307e56a:

    # mel "I appreciate you focusing on that, instead of making a cheesy comment about the beauty of a rose, or some shit."
    mel "感谢你关注重点，而不是说什么玫瑰带刺才美的老套话。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2949
translate chinese brothel4_72c97183:

    # blo "Hehe, you guys… I feel a little shallow saying this, but had a crush on [mc] as soon as I met him. He’s kinda… hot?"
    blo "呵呵，你们啊…虽然这么说可能有点肤浅，但我第一次见[mc]就心动了。他确实…挺火热的？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2950
translate chinese brothel4_0248676f:

    # "The others glance at me with inquisitive nods."
    "其他人都用探究的目光点头看我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2952
translate chinese brothel4_93e3fb5d:

    # blo "Still, if it weren’t for him going out of his way to help at the farm, I don’t think I’d be here now."
    blo "但如果不是他不辞辛劳在农场帮忙，我现在恐怕不会在这里。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2953
translate chinese brothel4_b57384e6:

    # blo "I was swamped with work and exhausted every night. The only reason I was able to reach out is because I finally had free time."
    blo "我被工作所淹没，每晚都筋疲力尽。之所以能联系你，是因为终于有了空闲时间。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2955
translate chinese brothel4_03d5c0b8:

    # mel "Wow, [mc], you’ve been rather busy, haven’t you?"
    mel "哇，[mc]，你最近挺忙的啊？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2956
translate chinese brothel4_7303534d:

    # "She leaned closer, her smirk widening into something downright predatory."
    "她靠得更近，笑容扩大成捕食者般的表情。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2958
translate chinese brothel4_b8aedd4a:

    # mel "Saving [blo] from the perils of overwork, patching things up between [sky] and [rik], and being my personal knight in shining armor. Makes a girl wonder just how much charm you’ve got left to spread around."
    mel "把[blo]从过度劳累中解救出来，调解[sky]和[rik]的矛盾，还当我的专属骑士。真让女孩好奇你还剩多少魅力可以分配呢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2959
translate chinese brothel4_1b99135e:

    # mc "Hey, I’m just trying to do the right thing. It’s not that impressive."
    mc "哎，我只是在做正确的事罢了。没那么了不起。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2961
translate chinese brothel4_675fa6b6:

    # sky "Not that impressive? You’ve practically been the glue holding us all together. Admit it — you’re a total overachiever!"
    sky "没那么了不起？你简直就是把我们凝聚在一起的粘合剂。承认吧——你根本是超额达标者！"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2963
translate chinese brothel4_490cad32:

    # blo "I’d say he’s like… a cornerstone. Something strong and steady that keeps everything in place."
    blo "要我说他像…基石。强大而稳固，让一切保持原位。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2965
translate chinese brothel4_3ea127f4:

    # mel "Cornerstone, huh? I don’t know if I’d call him ‘steady.’ He’s got a knack for stirring things up when you least expect it."
    mel "基石？不确定该不该用“稳固”来形容他。他总在猝不及防时搅动风云。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2966
translate chinese brothel4_de86992d:

    # "I held up my hands defensively, feeling the heat of their combined gazes."
    "我防御性地举起双手，感受到她们目光汇聚的热度。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2967
translate chinese brothel4_cb44ef68:

    # mc "Alright, alright. Enough about me. This is your reunion, not my roast session."
    mc "好了好了，关于我聊得够多了。这是你们的重聚，不是我的吐槽大会。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2969
translate chinese brothel4_341a1d01:

    # mel "Oh, sweetie, if this were a roast, we’d be bringing out the big guns."
    mel "哦，亲爱的，要是真开吐槽大会，我们可要动用重武器了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2971
translate chinese brothel4_cf4699aa:

    # sky "Don’t tempt her. She’s been sharpening those claws since elementary."
    sky "不要在意那些。毕竟她从小学就开始磨那些爪子了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2973
translate chinese brothel4_a12f8b98:

    # blo "Still, [mel]’s right about one thing. None of us would be here if it weren’t for you, [mc]. I mean, it’s not just the favors you’ve done for us. You actually believed in us when we didn’t even believe in ourselves."
    blo "不过[mel]有句话说对了。要不是因为你，[mc]，我们谁都不会在这儿。不仅是你帮过的忙，更是在我们自我怀疑时你依然相信我们。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2975
translate chinese brothel4_59cd67e6:

    # sky "Yeah… You worded it perfectly."
    sky "是啊…你说到点子上了。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2977
translate chinese brothel4_48788882:

    # mel "Hm… I agree."
    mel "嗯…同意。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2978
translate chinese brothel4_7c8faffd:

    # "Their words caught me off guard, leaving me momentarily speechless. I looked at each of them, their smiles genuine."
    "她们的话让我措手不及，一时语塞。我看向每一张脸，她们的笑容真挚动人。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2979
translate chinese brothel4_0d6f4338:

    # mc "You’re giving me too much credit. You’re the ones who put in the effort. I just… nudged things along."
    mc "你们过奖了。付出努力的是你们自己。我只是…顺势推了一把。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2981
translate chinese brothel4_da5f6f02:

    # mel "A modest hero, too. How infuriatingly perfect of you."
    mel "还是个谦虚的英雄呢。真是完美得让人火大。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2982
translate chinese brothel4_aa23b0b1:

    # "Their laughter broke the tension, and I couldn’t help but chuckle along. The warmth of their camaraderie was infectious. But then…"
    "她们的笑声打破了紧张氛围，我也忍不住跟着笑起来。这种友情间的温暖具有感染力。但随后…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2984
translate chinese brothel4_47a1b12d:

    # mel "So, since we’re all being so honest tonight…"
    mel "既然今晚大家都这么坦诚…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2985
translate chinese brothel4_27c5220b:

    # mel "Let’s talk about this little trend we’re noticing in the group chat..."
    mel "不如聊聊群聊里注意到的有趣趋势…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2986
translate chinese brothel4_967d1a26:

    # mc "I feel like I’m walking into a trap here."
    mc "感觉像正走进陷阱里呢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2988
translate chinese brothel4_cde6c1f1:

    # mel "Oh, don’t play coy now. You’ve fucked all three of us, haven’t you?"
    mel "哎呀别装糊涂啦。我们三个你都睡过了对吧？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2990
translate chinese brothel4_d30b45c5:

    # mc "Hmm, not all {i}three{/i} of you, but close."
    mc "嗯，不是你们{i} 三个 {/i}都睡过，但也差不多。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2992
translate chinese brothel4_2460c073:

    # sky "You mean to tell me our guy here has been, uh… multitasking?"
    sky "你是想说咱们这位在…呃…多线操作？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2994
translate chinese brothel4_b6e9af8b:

    # blo "It’s not like he planned it… He said it himself, how was he supposed to know?"
    blo "又不是他计划的…他自己也说了，怎么可能未卜先知呢？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2996
translate chinese brothel4_e58b2b14:

    # mel "Maybe not, but the results speak for themselves. We’ve got three women here, all thoroughly impressed by the same man. That’s not exactly a coincidence, is it?"
    mel "或许不是刻意，但结果说明一切。三位女性都被同一个男人深深打动，这总不能说是巧合吧？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2997
translate chinese brothel4_c5ebae5e:

    # "I opened my mouth to respond, but nothing came out. What could I say? It wasn’t like I’d intended for things to turn out this way."
    "我张口欲言却哑然失声。还能说什么呢？事情发展成这样并非我的本意。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:2998
translate chinese brothel4_582ce876:

    # mc "I… didn’t think this was the kind of thing we’d be discussing tonight."
    mc "我…没料到今晚会讨论这种事。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3000
translate chinese brothel4_90ca41be:

    # sky "Oh, don’t act so flustered. It’s cute. Besides, it’s not like any of us are mad about it."
    sky "哦，别表现得这么慌张嘛，挺可爱的。再说我们也没人为这个生气啊。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3002
translate chinese brothel4_c07a300a:

    # blo "Yeah, I mean… if anything, I’m kind of glad? If it weren’t for [mc], we wouldn’t even be here together like this. So… maybe it’s not such a bad thing."
    blo "其实…要说的话我还有点高兴？要不是[mc]，我们根本不会像这样聚在一起。所以…或许不是坏事呢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3004
translate chinese brothel4_8b3f32b6:

    # mel "Not a bad thing at all. In fact… *{i}She leaned closer, her voice dropping into a purr{/i}* I’d say it’s a pretty {b}great{/b} thing."
    mel "完全不是坏事。实际上…{i} 她贴近几分，声音变得像猫儿般的呼噜声 {/i}我觉得是件{b} 非常棒 {/b}的事。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3006
translate chinese brothel4_5dc259b0:

    # sky "So, what now? Are we supposed to fight over him or something? ‘Cause, uh, spoiler alert: I’d win."
    sky "所以现在怎么办？要为他争风吃醋吗？因为…剧透警告：赢的会是我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3008
translate chinese brothel4_92b3d4ac:

    # mel "Please, as if I’d let you."
    mel "得了吧，我怎么可能让你得逞。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3012
translate chinese brothel4_6fe7fede:

    # blo "You guys! We don’t need to fight…"
    blo "各位！我们没必要争吵…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3013
translate chinese brothel4_8b6a18ad:

    # blo "Maybe we don’t have to choose."
    blo "或许我们不必选择。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3014
translate chinese brothel4_f6ac9f3a:

    # mc "Are you suggesting…?"
    mc "你的意思是…？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3016
translate chinese brothel4_7caf371f:

    # mel "Sharing, hmm? Now there’s an idea. *{i}She tapped her chin thoughtfully{/i}* It’s unconventional, sure, but when have any of us been conventional?"
    mel "共享？嗯…这主意有意思。{i} 她若有所思地轻点下巴 {/i}确实非传统，但我们谁又传统过呢？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3018
translate chinese brothel4_ce33ba6d:

    # sky "Could be fun, but… wouldn't it be a lot of work? Think you could handle all three of us, [mc]?"
    sky "可能很有趣，但是…不会很累吗？觉得能应付我们三个吗，[mc]？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3019
translate chinese brothel4_1c1d4917:

    # mc "Hmm… *{i}I obviously know I’m going to say yes, but where’s the fun in playing easy to get?{/i}*"
    mc "嗯…{i} 明明知道会答应，但轻易得手多无趣 {/i}"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3021
translate chinese brothel4_b11b546a:

    # blo "I-I mean, only if you’re okay with it! I wouldn’t want to pressure anyone…"
    blo "我-我是说只要你们同意！我不想给任何人压力…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3023
translate chinese brothel4_3131c12e:

    # mel "Oh, sweetheart, trust me — this one can handle a lot more than he lets on."
    mel "哦，亲爱的，相信我——这家伙的承受力可比表现出的强得多。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3024
translate chinese brothel4_cdcd3c7b:

    # "Their teasing words left me feeling equally besieged and amused. They were serious — at least, as serious as they ever were."
    "她们调侃的话语让我既感到无奈又好笑。她们是认真的——至少以她们一贯的标准来说算认真。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3025
translate chinese brothel4_8a9ac106:

    # "Three women who’d found their way back to each other — and, somehow, to me."
    "三位女孩重新找回彼此——而且不知怎的，也找到了我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3026
translate chinese brothel4_1decd334:

    # mc "You’re all ridiculous, you know that?"
    mc "你们都很离谱，知道吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3028
translate chinese brothel4_14b0d8a8:

    # sky "Maybe. But you love it."
    sky "或许吧。但你就爱这样。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3030
translate chinese brothel4_70e07937:

    # mel "And, apparently, you love us, in your own special way."
    mel "而且，很明显，你用自己独特的方式爱着我们。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3032
translate chinese brothel4_cdb27985:

    # blo "So… does that mean it’s okay?"
    blo "所以…这样是可以的吗？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3033
translate chinese brothel4_d86d2e05:

    # "This wasn’t what I’d expected, but looking at them; [mel]’s sly grin, [sky]’s bold confidence, [blo]’s gentle warmth..."
    "这并非我预想的情景，但看着她们：[mel]狡黠的笑，[sky]大胆的自信，[blo]温柔的暖意…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3034
translate chinese brothel4_4ca92b4a:

    # mc "If this is what you all want… then who am I to say no?"
    mc "如果这是你们想要的…我有什么理由拒绝呢？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3035
translate chinese brothel4_4bdb84c9:

    # "Their laughter rang out again. Triumph! Whatever came next, I knew one thing for sure: it was going to be one hell of a ride."
    "她们的笑声再次响起。大获全胜！无论接下来发生什么，我确信一件事：这注定是段非凡的旅程。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3037
translate chinese brothel4_86bc2955:

    # mel "Alright, now that we’re all on the same page, sort of, why don’t we make this a little more… private?"
    mel "好了，既然我们基本达成共识…不如让气氛更私密些？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3038
translate chinese brothel4_bf9a2037:

    # "She gestured towards the private booths."
    "她指了指私人包厢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3040
translate chinese brothel4_c57b79f6:

    # sky "Lead the way, madam president."
    sky "带路吧，总统女士。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3042
translate chinese brothel4_1084ebf4:

    # mel "Please don’t call me that."
    mel "请别这么称呼我。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3045
translate chinese brothel4_aeac6de1:

    # "I followed as they gathered their drinks and slipped into the private room."
    "我跟着她们拿起饮料溜进私人包厢。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3048
translate chinese brothel4_e9080280:

    # "[mel] took her seat first, with [blo] and [sky] sliding in next to her."
    "[mel]先坐下，[blo]和[sky]随之滑入她身旁。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3050
translate chinese brothel4_6e67149b:

    # mel "Now that we’re away from prying eyes…"
    mel "既然已经避开了窥探的视线…"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3056
translate chinese brothel4_a3ff8de0:

    # "She swirled her drink lazily, her gaze darting between [sky] and [blo]."
    "她慵懒地晃着酒杯，目光在[sky]和[blo]之间流转。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3058
translate chinese brothel4_516109a2:

    # mel "There’s something we should probably talk about before we dive headfirst into this little arrangement."
    mel "在我们全身心投入这个小小安排之前，有件事可能需要先谈谈。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3059
translate chinese brothel4_db7b11fd:

    # mc "What’s that?"
    mc "那是什么？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3061
translate chinese brothel4_944ebabe:

    # mel "Well, {i}sharing{/i} you is one thing. But if this is going to work, how do we feel about… sharing each other? I know you two aren't strangers to a little carpet-diving."
    mel "好吧，{i} 分享 {/i}你是一回事。但如果真要这样，你觉得…互相分享怎么样？我知道你们俩对地毯探险并不陌生。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3065
translate chinese brothel4_1751f5da:

    # "[blo]’s cheeks flushed immediately, her eyes widening as she stared at her drink. [sky], on the other hand, snorted."
    "[blo]的脸颊立刻红了，她睁大眼睛盯着自己的饮料。[sky]却在一旁哼了一声。"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3066
translate chinese brothel4_e2e26bca:

    # sky "I have experience, but you mean… like, we’ll be more than friends?"
    sky "我有过一些经历，但你的意思是…我们会超越普通朋友的关系？"

# game/4.2 - Brothel Route.rpy:3068
